@* Rhode Has a Hailey Problem: my Rhode strategy, the 6th project in the Marketing carousel (rendered from _MarketingWork.cshtml).
   The look: Rhode's milky neutrals (oat, cream, espresso) with a glazed sheen. Same slideshow as the other decks.
   Numbers checked Oct 2026: e.l.f.'s deal announcement (AP, May 2025), e.l.f. fiscal 2026 results, Cosmetics Business (Sephora launch).
   The cover video is a motion graphic I made: a glazed drop, and one name repeating until it fills the frame. *@
<style>
