                <p class="r-kick">rhode strategy, 2026</p>
                <h4 class="r-title">Rhode has a<br /><em>Hailey problem.</em></h4>
                <p class="r-lede">A $390M beauty brand runs on one face. Here’s how to make it outlive the fame.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-slide" data-title="Winning" hidden>
                @Html.Raw(rsig)
                <p class="r-kick">where rhode stands</p>
