                </div>
                <p class="r-cap">e.l.f. Beauty deal terms, May 2025: up to $1B over three years</p>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-slide" data-title="One face" hidden>
                @Html.Raw(rsig)
                <div class="r-two" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr">
                    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.4cqw">
                        <p class="r-kick">the real risk</p>
                        <h4 class="r-h">Every line runs <em>through one person.</em></h4>
                        <div class="r-rule"></div>
                        <p class="r-lede">Fans don’t just buy Rhode. They buy Hailey’s skin, Hailey’s phone case, Hailey’s routine. That’s rocket fuel, until she gets busy, gets bored, or steps back.</p>
                        <p class="r-lede">A brand that can’t lose its founder isn’t a brand yet. It’s an endorsement.</p>
