                        <div class="r-rule"></div>
                        <p class="r-lede">Sephora sells the core. Rhode.com keeps the magic: limited lip case colors, shades and collabs released only to a members’ waitlist, in small batches, with a countdown.</p>
                        <p class="r-lede">Everyone can buy Rhode. Only members can catch the drop.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="r-phone" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><em>members only</em><span class="r-drop">next drop in 02:14:09</span></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-slide" data-title="Kill, keep" hidden>
                @Html.Raw(rsig)
                <p class="r-kick">the hard calls</p>
                <h4 class="r-h">Less Hailey in the ads. <em>More Rhode in the world.</em></h4>
                <div class="r-rule"></div>
                <div class="r-kk">
                    <div class="r-card kill">
                        <small>KILL</small>
                        <b>Hailey in every campaign</b>
                        <b>Launching a full makeup line fast</b>
                        <b>Every product, everywhere, all the time</b>
                    </div>
                    <div class="r-card">
                        <small>KEEP</small>
                        <b>A tiny lineup of heroes</b>
                        <b>Sold-out drops, only online</b>
