                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mk-slide r-cover" data-title="The takeaway" hidden>
                <video class="r-bg" src="/videos/projects/rhode.mp4" poster="/videos/projects/rhode.jpg" muted loop playsinline autoplay aria-hidden="true"></video>
                @Html.Raw(rsig)
                <p class="r-kick">how to measure it</p>
                <h4 class="r-title" style="font-size:clamp(22px, 4.8cqw, 56px);max-width:52cqw">Rhode doesn’t need less Hailey. <em>It needs more Rhode.</em></h4>
                <p class="r-lede"><b style="color:#2B2622">The one number:</b> Hailey-free demand, the share of sales and buzz that doesn’t start with one of her posts. When it passes half, Rhode is a brand.</p>
