            <li>Connected it to my Glossier case: the same move into Sephora, one step earlier</li>
            <li>Three moves: make the product the celebrity, build a bench of faces, and keep the drop alive</li>
            <li>Invented Hailey-free demand, the share of sales that doesn’t start with her</li>
        </ul>
